      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Israel has seven democratic allies left in the Senate.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2046348939520266726",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-20T22:03:01+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Happy 420 From @ClubRandom_ &amp; @theWOODSWeHo!\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2046234656677515740",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-20T14:28:54+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I thought about doing this without any jokes, something I've never done here in 23 years, to impress upon people how much different I feel this issue is from any I have ever covered.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2045337329746022895",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-18T03:03:14+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Israel and Lebanon have agreed to a 10-day ceasefire! Hezbollah could tell something was going on because their pagers were blowing up.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2045337128272642145",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-18T03:02:26+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": ".@AndyDick this week at @ClubRandom_!\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2044078142927569291",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-14T15:39:41+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Being an adult often means choosing between two horrible options, like the food on United.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2042806830620164230",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-11T03:27:56+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Earlier this week, Trump threatened to wipe out Iran\u2019s \u201cwhole civilization.\u201d He said: I\u2019m not bluffing. Did you see what I did to Atlantic City?\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2042806620170916301",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-11T03:27:06+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The Democrats are not going to win the midterms; the Republicans are going to lose it.\n\nVideo",
